   200	### 3.1 LOCAL-KELLER: the exact form of the charge's conditions at one disc
   201	
   202	> **LEMMA LOCAL-KELLER (PROVED-HERE).** With `x = t^{-1}` and `y = w(t) + π t^{δ}`,
   203	> ```text
   204	>    ∂(x,y)/∂(t,π) = det [[ −t^{-2}, 0 ], [ w' + πδ t^{δ-1}, t^{δ} ]] = −t^{δ−2},
