   508	   group count TO THE UNIT, from an independently written enumerator.
   509	```
   510	
   511	**No group anywhere is killed by `L > 16`, none by `U < 2`.** The two-sided *size*
   512	window `[L,U]` is therefore not a filter: `L` is small and `U` large.
   513	
   514	### 5.2 The filter that IS new: integrality
   515	
   516	`N` is an integer, and D1-PIN says `N = sum_B V_2(B) q(B)` with `sum_B V_2(B) <= u`.
   517	Writing `q = p/r` in lowest terms, a **single-branch** skeleton must have `r | V_2`,
   518	and more generally the denominators must cancel across branches. On Moh's own six
   519	published rows (CONTROL 5) the achievable sets are small and all nonempty:
   520	
   521	```text
   522	  row                      u       q   r    p    U = u q    achievable N (uniform branches)
   523	  (64,48)                 12     3/4   4    3          9    3, 6, 9
   524	  (84,56) M2=64,V2=2      21     2/7   7    2          6    2, 4, 6
   525	  (84,56) M2=72,V2=5      21     1/2   2    1       21/2    1, 2, …, 10
   526	  (75,50) V2=3            20     3/5   5    3         12    3, 6, 9, 12
   527	  (75,50) V2=2            20     2/5   5    2          8    2, 4, 6, 8
   528	  (99,66)                 24     2/3   3    2         16    2, 4, 6, …, 16
   529	```
   530	All four of Moh's survivors carry an achievable `N` inside the campaign's window; the
   531	`(84,56)` `M_2 = 64` row is pinned to `N in {4,6}` under H2, and `(64,48)` to
   532	`N in {6,9}`. **The integrality condition is nontrivial and Moh's survivors pass it**
   533	— as they must, since they were killed only by his Appendix II elimination.
   534	
   535	Two runs differ in one hypothesis. **(UNI)**: all bottom major discs carry the same
   536	lower-`V` datum — true within one Galois orbit (the Galois action of `C((t))` is an
   537	isometry of the tree, so it permutes bottom discs preserving `(a_1, delta_1)`), a
   538	HYPOTHESIS when there is more than one orbit; then `N = k V_2 q` with `k V_2 <= u`.
   539	**General**: `N = sum_B V_2(B) q(B)`, `sum_B V_2(B) <= u`, by exact knapsack over
   540	`Fraction`s pruned to sums `<= 16` with a 60 000-state cap; capped groups are counted
   541	as SURVIVING, so the reported kill is a FLOOR on the true kill.
