+| 7. Nullstellensatz table | **GAP as bundled** | 15/15 existence decisions **CAN**; “explicit witnesses for all 15” **CANNOT** |
+| 8. controls 78/0 | **GAP in one printed table** | controls 1 and 3 **CAN**; two-tower qualitative failure **CAN after correcting `lambda_g`** |
+| 9. DELTA-DENOM measurement | **CONFIRMED as measurement** | **CAN** as a measurement only; no filter adjudicated here |
+| `D = 105` selection/counts | **GAP if read as attainment** | census arithmetic **CAN**; “there are 20 discs, hence `N=6`” **CANNOT** |
