+
+Live driver prefixes match `TF:39-42`; live/frozen `bottomode.py` and
+`d1floor.py` are identical. Exact CAS used one-core environment variables and
+SymPy over `QQ`. `orders.py` and `order2.py` reproduced their logs bytewise; an
+independent SymPy calculation rebuilt their matrix/source. Controls 1, 3, 4
