+| arithmetic window | surviving assignments | groups with at least one surviving assignment | killed groups |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| integer `N>=2` | 90 | 69 | 195 |
+| integer `N in [4,16]` (D1's H2 column) | 64 | 55 | 209 |
+| integer `N>=6` | 63 | 48 | 216 |
