+```text
+QQ[q_0,...,q_(b-2),w]
+```
+
+with generator order `list(unk)+[w]`; `pi` has been eliminated before the
+Groebner call. The augmented ideal is
+
+```text
+I=<TRUNC equations, w kappa-1>.                               (9.1)
+```
