+## 9. Nullstellensatz existence table
+
+`star.py:38-47` takes monic translation-normalized `Q=p_f`, kills the
+`pi^-1,...,pi^[-(b-2)]` coefficients of `Q^(e/d)`, and lets `P=p_g` be the
