+```
+
+so the third profile is
+
+```text
+[(d+e)V-1, 1^gamma],       gamma=V(de-d-e)+1.                 (5.5)
+```
+
+Moreover
+
+```text
+R'=-kappa Q^(e-1)/P^(d+1),
+```
+
+so there are no other branch values. Riemann--Hurwitz closes:
+
+```text
+dV(e-1)+eV(d-1)+[(d+e)V-2]=2deV-2.
