+For `A>1`, each polynomial has support in one residue class modulo `A`.
+Evaluation of the Wronskian at `pi=0` then forces exactly one pattern:
+
+```text
+(a_1,b_1)=(1,0) mod A, with pi|p_g and pi not|p_f; or
