+## 10. Controls
+
+I reran three of the four suites, including the required two-tower suite:
+
+```text
+control1.py   24 checks, 0 failures
+control3.py   12 checks, 0 failures
+control4.py   21 checks, 0 failures
+-----------------------------------
+rerun         57 checks, 0 failures
+```
