+```text
+p_g=pi^3+p_1 pi,
+p_f=q_2(pi^2+(2/3)p_1),
+kappa=(4/3)p_1^2 q_2,       p_1 q_2 != 0.
+```
+
+The other component has `q_2=0`, violates `deg p_f=2`, and has `kappa=0`.
