+```text
+generic E:                 rank 5, kernel 2, cokernel 0;
+E in {0,1/20,1/10,3/20}: rank 4, kernel 3, cokernel 1;
+E=1/5=4mu:                rank 5, kernel 2, cokernel 0.
+```
+
+This reproduces `orders.py:28-43` and `TF:327-334`.
