+For coefficient vectors `(u_0,u_1,u_2,v_0,v_1,v_2,v_3)`, independent SymPy
+expansion of `L_E` gives the matrix
+
+```text
+[ 1/10-E       0          0          0       1/15        0          0 ]
+[    0      -E-1/20       0       3/10-2E      0       2/15         0 ]
+[ 3E-3/10      0       -E-1/5       0       1/5-2E      0         1/5]
