+
+The selected arithmetic row recomputes exactly:
+
+```text
+n=105, m=70, K=35, (d,e)=(2,3), s=3,
+M=(-70,-63,103), d-chain=(105,35,7,1), V=(1,4,1),
+delta=(3/4,71/95,-1),
+(a_1,a_2,a_3)=(3,60,105), (b_1,b_2,b_3)=(2,40,70),
+(lambda_g)_1=-3/20, (lambda_f)_1=-1/10,
+u=20, q=3/10.
